-- Pharmacists are visible to signed-in users (already in policy)
-- Prescriptions: patients can see own, pharmacists can see all (already in policies)
-- Dispenses: pharmacists can see all (already in policies)

-- Ensure anon role has no access (already set by anonymous access denied policies)
