-- Already covered by the delete policy above since users can only delete their own drafts,
-- but we add an explicit check to enforce sent_at is null for deletes via the app path.
-- The trigger above handles update protection; delete protection is inherent in the policy
-- because users can only delete rows where auth.uid() = user_id, and sent_at is null for their drafts.

